1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/mysql/mysql-master-slave-new-questions","children":["MySQL 底层原理丨主从复制带来的新问题"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/mysql-master-slave-new-questions.jpg","alt":"MySQL 底层原理丨主从复制带来的新问题 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"数据库"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"MySQL 底层原理丨主从复制带来的新问题"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇将探讨主从复制带来的新问题。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-12-17T21:57:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/12/17"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,341"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["在单机数据库模式下，我们享受了太多的理所当然：ACID 事务、强一致性读写、瞬间的数据可见性。然而，一旦引入了",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"异步主从复制"}],"，这个美好的世界就崩塌了。系统从",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"CP (一致性)"}]," 模型滑向了",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"AP (可用性)"}]," 模型。",["$","strong","strong-3",{"children":"主从延迟（Replication Lag）"}]," 像一个幽灵，让许多在单机下奉为圭臬的最佳实践，变成了分布式环境下的致命陷阱。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"核心矛盾根源：真相的传播延迟"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"单机模式"}],"：\"真相\"只有一个（唯一的 DB 实例）。写入即事实，读取即真相。时间差近乎为零。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"主从模式"}],"：\"真相\"在传播。主库是当前的真相，从库是几百毫秒甚至几秒前的\"历史影像\"。",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"依赖历史影像做决策，必然出错"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"从单机到主从架构的升级，不是简单的加几台机器，而是一场思维方式的革命："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"放弃对实时强一致性的幻想"}],"：在分布式系统中，除了核心的金融级数据，大部分场景都要接受",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"最终一致性"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"识别真理之源"}],"：时刻清楚 Master DB 是唯一的真理。Slave DB 只是用于分担非敏感读压力的快照副本。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"防御性编程"}],"：写代码时，永远要假设你读到的数据可能是旧的，并思考\"如果它是旧的，我的业务逻辑会不会炸？\"如果会炸，就必须升级方案（走主库、加异步校验链等）。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"本篇接下来就梳理单机模式最佳实践在主从架构下失效的经典场景。"}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"1-缓存一致性","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#1-缓存一致性","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#1-缓存一致性"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 缓存一致性","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":4,"offset":602},"end":{"line":16,"column":12,"offset":610}}}]},"children":"1. 缓存一致性"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"在单机模式下，为了应对 MySQL 和 Redis（缓存）的一致性，业界通用的解决方案是 Cache Aside（旁路缓存）。即：先更新 DB，再删缓存。下次读请求发现 Cache Miss，查 DB 并回填。因 DB 里的数据永远是最新的，回填缓存没问题。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"但是在主从模式下就不一样了："}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["写请求删了缓存。读请求去",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"从库"}],"查到了旧数据（因为延迟）。读请求把",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"旧数据"}],"当作新数据塞回了 Redis。结果就导致了 Redis 里存储了脏数据。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"总结","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#总结","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#总结"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"总结","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":4,"offset":844},"end":{"line":24,"column":6,"offset":846}}}]},"children":"总结"}]}],"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",["$","table","table-0",{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"核心场景"}]}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"单机模式下的最佳实践 (Best Practice)"}]}],["$","th","th-2",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"主从模式下的失效原因 (The Trap)"}]}],["$","th","th-3",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"必须升级的分布式方案 (The Upgrade Path)"}]}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":["$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc"]}]]}]]}]}],"$Ld","$Le","$Lf"]}],"$L10"]}]]}]}]
